  <item>
    <title>041.你挑食吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6867f7c193fd2d72b8937845</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6867f7c193fd2d72b8937845</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 05 Jul 2025 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎来到今天的节目！说到挑食，咱可都得承认，这世界美食千千万，总有些东西咱就是吃不惯。今天，我们邀请到了点儿6，一起聊聊那些爱吃和不爱吃的美食。不过，先给大家提个醒，这期节目可有点“重口味”！我们不仅会聊到那些大多数人避之不及的食物，还会提到一些让人望而生畏的“可怕食物”。但也说不定你会在这些“黑暗料理”里发现新大陆呢！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154">02:34</a> 聊挑食和地域饮食文化差异</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="568">09:28</a> 美食的分类与个人口味偏好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1073">17:53</a> 饮食习惯与个人最不能接受的食物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1651">27:31</a> 讨论十大讨厌食物及个人口味偏好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1823">30:23</a> 挑食：植物性食物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2611">43:31</a> 挑食：水果</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2926">48:46</a> 挑食：坚果</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3345">55:45</a> 挑食：动物性食物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3795">01:03:15</a> 挑食：海鲜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4548">01:15:48</a> 挑食：虫子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4948">01:22:28</a> 挑食：菌类</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5095">01:24:55</a> 挑食：混合性食物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5237">01:27:17</a> 猎奇美食：从油炸蟑螂到童子尿煮鸡蛋</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>木耳菜</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoJFbPGxvANzDrxsREG21aM_jpNp.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>芦蒿</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqh2uRGLd9d5ZBoEOoaUTOO63D9k.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>猪头排</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnhePHaFJ9tykZcqNHQfcvNBUBCQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>毛蛋</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlDA7X1q7U0ParG6z7h4NAf-c5Om.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>蟛蜞酱</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpSpOuAgfJ9WS2QGSCcxwWK_PLcz.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>青蛙汁</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh7xmK5zaACoeBqu4uE2qoA1N8pu.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>田鼠干</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FubJ7AeNOkR9resyJtWMBzk9_HR2.png"></figure>]]></description>
