  <item>
    <title>038.【宜出门】转转温州</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6831e4e841ef875a1206a229</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6831e4e841ef875a1206a229</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 25 May 2025 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“宜出门”系列又双叒叕更新啦！最近咱整点播客忙里偷闲，到处溜达，感受外面的世界。接下来，“宜出门”系列也会继续给大家唠唠，我们都去哪儿“浪”了，保证让你听得过瘾。本期节目阿山带着他的小伙伴出发了，目的地是温润之州——温州。虽然这次旅程时间不长，但真的是丰富多彩，收获满满！接下来，跟着阿山还有嘉宾.5的脚步，一起去温州感受一下那里的风土人情，看看他们到底都干了啥，吃了啥，玩了啥！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">03:10</a> 四人对温州的初印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="349">05:49</a> 温州春游之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="702">11:42</a> 温州特色猪头排、特色佐餐酱油</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 自驾百丈漈之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1865">31:05</a> 头漈：观瀑亭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2169">36:09</a> 穿越二漈水帘洞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2355">39:15</a> 三漈平静流水、返程的刺激观光巴士</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2808">46:48</a> 生吃蟹与猪脏粉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3061">51:01</a> 洞头区环岛游和海边落日美景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3450">57:30</a> 特色美食：鱼圆粉、家烧面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3704">01:01:44</a> 温州景点推荐及旅游小贴士</span></p>]]></description>
