    <title>029.【假装文化人】人与神的爱情长卷《洛神赋图》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67bc557b606e5c59408639f4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67bc557b606e5c59408639f4</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Feb 2025 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>整点播客的全新节目——“假装文化人”上线了！我们不搞枯燥的科普，只求轻松分享那些让我们着迷的兴趣爱好，和大家一起聊聊艺术，给自己披上一层“文化人”的外衣~ 本期节目，我们带你穿越回1800年前，去探秘十大传世名画之一的《洛神赋图》，讲述它背后的爱情故事，欣赏顾恺之的神来之笔。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="111">01:51</a> 中国十大传世名画及洛神赋图</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="369">06:09</a> 曹植的《洛神赋》与《洛神赋图》的创作背景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="587">09:47</a> 东晋画家顾恺之的生平趣事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="793">13:13</a> 《洛神赋图》的各个临摹版本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="956">15:56</a> 《洛神赋图》第一部分邂逅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1398">23:18</a> 《洛神赋图》第二部分定情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1547">25:47</a> 《洛神赋图》第三部分情变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1935">32:15</a>《洛神赋图》第四部分分离</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2290">38:10</a> 《洛神赋图》第五部分怅归</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2659">44:19</a> 《洛神赋图》中的细节与影响</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpPIuPIIRK_E7RwaILEhM9k9bZ58.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrobQgM3xVy31PMWm7Rp2D1TCjW2.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkK7j0wUl6fSaCa9LYAsX2UNwNLs.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuORG1H2NFcU2iblw_hc-4TEc9aJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlePecUjaamsBj_xwFsVf-XUilgj.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FngauYrLxcQ0V5EvLMKwpcL1YtB8.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
