  <item>
    <title>028.提不起劲的职场生活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67ae123e05a90dfd0d523800</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67ae123e05a90dfd0d523800</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 15 Feb 2025 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>来了，来了！——“整点播客”又满血复活啦！是不是已经迫不及待想听我们唠唠嗑了？那今天咱们就好好唠唠，聊聊职场里的那些事儿，保证让你又气又好笑！你知道的，职场里啥都有，卷王卷到飞起，大喇叭传得满世界都是八卦，笑面虎更是让人防不胜防。还有那些意义不明的团建活动，开到让人怀疑人生的大小会议，以及那些五彩斑斓的黑的离谱要求。今天就让我们用这些真实又荒诞的故事，给你的忙碌工作加点料，顺便帮你开心地“摸摸鱼”，放松一下。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="137">02:17</a> 职场中的“七大毒人”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">10:10</a> 职场中面试的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="823">13:43</a> 职场中那些不会好好说话的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1550">25:50</a> 职场中那些“卷王”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2264">37:44</a> 职场中的各种八卦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2941">49:01</a> 职场中没完没了的工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3622">01:00:22</a> 职场中的“偷窥狂”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3854">01:04:14</a> 职场中的“老抠儿”和“贪小便宜”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4230">01:10:30</a> 职场中的团建</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4463">01:14:23</a> 职场中头痛的甲乙方和竞争</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4760">01:19:20</a> 职场中的心理/生理痛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5102">01:25:02</a> 职场给你的积极引导</span></p>]]></description>
